llāh, who created the heavens and earth and did not fail in their creation, is able to give life to the dead? Yes. Indeed, He is over all things competent.","j":26,"h":51,"s":46,"a":33,"sd":null},{"k":"46:34","t":"And the Day those who disbelieved are exposed to the Fire [it will be said], \"Is this not the truth?\" They will say, \"Yes, by our Lord.\" He will say, \"Then taste the punishment for what you used to deny.\"","j":26,"h":51,"s":46,"a":34,"sd":null},{"k":"46:35","t":"So be patient, [O Muḥammad], as were those of determination among the messengers and do not be impatient for them. It will be - on the Day they see that which they are promised - as though they had not remained [in the world] except an hour of a day. [This is] notification. And will [any] be destroyed except the defiantly disobedient people?","j":26,"h":51,"s":46,"a":35,"sd":null}],"juz":26,"hizb":51,"surahs":[46],"sajdah":false}